<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Santos has another Cooper gas find.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Santos has another Cooper gas find.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santos Ltd said on Friday it made a new field discovery in the South Australian section of the onshore Cooper/Eromanga basin with the Gudi One wildcat well flowing 224,000 cubic metres of gas a day and 150 barrels of condensate.</p>
<p>The flow came from reservoir sands at a depth of 2,848-2,862 metres and was achieved through a half inch choke.</p>
<p>Santos is the operator and has a 69.3522 percent stake in the field followed by Delhi Petroleum 17.143 percent, Boral Ltd unit Boral Energy 10.536 pct and Crusader Resources NL 2.9688 percent.</p>
</text>
